    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "type": "MCQ",
    "question": "The product of (x + 8)(x - 10) is equal to:",
    "options": [
      "x² - 2x + 80",
      "x² - 2x - 80",
      "x² + 2x + 80",
      "x² + 2x - 80"
    ],
    "answer": "x² - 2x - 80",
    "explanation": "Using the identity (x + a)(x + b) = x² + (a + b)x + ab: (x + 8)(x - 10) = x² + (8 - 10)x + (8)(-10) = x² - 2x - 80.",
    "marks": 1
  },
