    "question": "If 120² - 20² = 25p, then p is equal to:",
    "options": [
      "16",
      "140",
      "560",
      "14000"
    ],
    "answer": "560",
    "explanation": "Using a² - b² = (a - b)(a + b): 120² - 20² = (120 - 20)(120 + 20) = (100)(140) = 14000. Therefore, 25p = 14000 ⇒ p = 14000 / 25 = 560.",
    "marks": 1
  },
