    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "type": "MCQ",
    "question": "<b>[Formula Application - Numerical Scenario]</b> If you need to calculate the product of two numbers like <b>104 × 96</b> quickly without standard long multiplication, which special product formula should you select?",
    "options": [
      "(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²",
      "(a - b)² = a² - 2ab + b²",
      "(a + b)(a - b) = a² - b²",
      "(x + a)(x + b) = x² + (a + b)x + ab"
    ],
    "answer": "(a + b)(a - b) = a² - b²",
    "explanation": "104 × 96 can be written as (100 + 4)(100 - 4), which directly matches the form (a + b)(a - b) = a² - b² (i.e., 100² - 4² = 10000 - 16 = 9984).",
    "marks": 1
  },
