    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "type": "MCQ",
    "question": "<b>[Formula Matching (LHS to RHS)]</b> Which of the following represents the correct expanded formula for the binomial cube identity <b>(a - b)³</b>?",
    "options": [
      "a³ + b³ + 3ab(a + b)",
      "a³ - b³ - 3ab(a - b)",
      "a³ - b³ + 3ab(a - b)",
