    "answer": "Using the algebraic identity (a - b)³ = a³ - b³ - 3ab(a - b) where a = 4x and b = 5z:\n(4x - 5z)³ = (4x)³ - (5z)³ - 3(4x)(5z)(4x - 5z)\nSubstitute the given values:\n(16)³ = 64x³ - 125z³ - 60(xz)(16)\n4096 = 64x³ - 125z³ - 60(12)(16)\n4096 = 64x³ - 125z³ - 11520\n64x³ - 125z³ = 4096 + 11520 = 15616.",
